<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Monday. The three-month rate was flat at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>			 February 10 fix	February 7 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.02 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.09 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.19 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.28 pct		3.28 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.37 pct		3.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
